    "title": "Bose QuietComfort Ultra Wireless Noise-Canceling Headphones (2nd Gen)",
    "description": "The Bose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones (2nd Gen) in Black are premium over-ear wireless noise-cancelling headphones designed for high-fidelity listening across various activities including music, travel, commuting, and gaming. They feature advanced active noise cancellation with multiple modes (Quiet, Aware, Custom, and Wind Block) and CustomTune™ technology that personalizes sound and ANC based on the listener's ear shape. These headphones introduce Bose TrueSpatial™ Immersive Audio with Still, Motion, and Cinema modes to enhance the spatial presentation of stereo content. Connectivity is handled via Bluetooth 5.4 with Snapdragon Sound support, including aptX Adaptive and aptX Lossless for CD-quality wireless audio, alongside USB-C digital audio and a 2.5mm-to-3.5mm analog cable. They offer up to 30 hours of battery life with ANC enabled, with a quick-charge feature providing 2.5 hours of playback from a 15-minute charge. The design includes plush synthetic-leather ear cushions, a padded headband, and polished metal components, all foldable for portability in the included hard carrying case.",
